WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.097
Open Commerce, Customers.

00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:10.896
The people and businesses that bought from you are listed with the most recently active first.

00:00:10.896 --> 00:00:14.607
A badge marks a guest or a business, and each row shows an

00:00:14.607 --> 00:00:17.100
email and when they were last active.

00:00:17.563 --> 00:00:21.363
Type the start of a name, a company or an email in the

00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:24.783
search box and press Enter to find one customer.

00:00:25.246 --> 00:00:28.523
The list beside the count narrows what is shown:

00:00:28.523 --> 00:00:33.682
customers With an account, Guests, Businesses, Disabled ones, or All customers.

00:00:33.682 --> 00:00:37.506
Choose Businesses to see the companies that buy from you.

